  "description": "DEPRECATED - use GroupDocs.Viewer instead.\n\n      This package has been merged into GroupDocs.Viewer, which as of 26.8.0 ships\n      per-TFM runtime packages that are cross-platform on Windows, Linux, and macOS.\n      On net6.0 it resolves GroupDocs.Viewer.Net60, which carries the same\n      GroupDocs.CrossPlatform.NativeAssets and SkiaSharp Linux assets this package\n      did. Replace the reference with GroupDocs.Viewer - the assembly name,\n      namespaces, and public API are unchanged, so no code changes are needed.\n\n      This version contains no assemblies. It only forwards to GroupDocs.Viewer.",
